{"id":"94d543cad7d7ee3b","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-single-letter-fixed-algorithm.md","title":"Bounded Trace Construction of a Letterless Fixed Point","display":"df-single-letter-fixed-algorithm — Bounded Trace Construction of a Letterless Fixed Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-single-letter-fixed-algorithm","aliases":["89-df-single-letter-fixed-algorithm"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"df-single-letter-fixed-algorithm — Bounded Trace Construction of a Letterless Fixed Point","depends_on":["[[89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace]]","[[89-df-modal-degree]]","[[89-df-letterless-normal-form]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-single-letter-fixed-algorithm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-single-letter-fixed-algorithm</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"df-single-letter-fixed-algorithm — Bounded Trace Construction of a Letterless Fixed Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c9feb1083d7b4dd\" href=\"?note=4c9feb1083d7b4dd\" title=\"89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace\">89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04ea1c6ff126f884\" href=\"?note=04ea1c6ff126f884\" title=\"89-df-modal-degree\">89-df-modal-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"932deccafc8aeaa8\" href=\"?note=932deccafc8aeaa8\" title=\"89-df-letterless-normal-form\">89-df-letterless-normal-form</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 仅含字母 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 模态化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=b_{\\Box}(A)\">\\(n=b_{\\Box}(A)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_A\">\\(t_A\\)</span> 为 A-trace 双递归；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_i\">\\(R_i\\)</span> 为无字母秩标记，有限索引序列按自然数递增排列。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^{\\mathrm{tr}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\">\\(H^{\\mathrm{tr}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\)</span> 为下文定义的公式函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}single\\text{-}letter\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}algorithm}\\vdash\nH^{\\mathrm{tr}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\bigvee\\langle R_i:i&lt;n,\\ t_A(A,i)=1\\rangle,&amp;t_A(A,n)=0,\\\\\n\\bigwedge\\langle\\neg R_i:i&lt;n,\\ t_A(A,i)=0\\rangle,&amp;t_A(A,n)=1.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}single\\text{-}letter\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}algorithm}\\vdash\nH^{\\mathrm{tr}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\bigvee\\langle R_i:i&lt;n,\\ t_A(A,i)=1\\rangle,&amp;t_A(A,n)=0,\\\\\n\\bigwedge\\langle\\neg R_i:i&lt;n,\\ t_A(A,i)=0\\rangle,&amp;t_A(A,n)=1.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 109–111；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>两条有限筛选序列都按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=0,\\ldots,n-1\">\\(i=0,\\ldots,n-1\\)</span> 的原顺序取项。只需计算秩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\ldots,n\">\\(0,\\ldots,n\\)</span> 的 A-trace 与实际使用的子公式；不枚举全部 p-公式，不调用 GL 判定器。空列表分别给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\top\">\\(\\bot,\\top\\)</span>。稳定性引理保证尾部的值已由第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 行确定；每个所用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_i\">\\(R_i\\)</span> 度数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i+1\\le n\">\\(i+1\\le n\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace","status":"resolved","id":"4c9feb1083d7b4dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-degree","status":"resolved","id":"04ea1c6ff126f884","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-letterless-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"932deccafc8aeaa8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-letterless-normal-form]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"n=b_{\\Box}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"t_A","display":false},{"tex":"R_i","display":false},{"tex":"H^{\\mathrm{tr}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}single\\text{-}letter\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}algorithm}\\vdash\nH^{\\mathrm{tr}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\bigvee\\langle R_i:i<n,\\ t_A(A,i)=1\\rangle,&t_A(A,n)=0,\\\\\n\\bigwedge\\langle\\neg R_i:i<n,\\ t_A(A,i)=0\\rangle,&t_A(A,n)=1.\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"i=0,\\ldots,n-1","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\ldots,n","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot,\\top","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"R_i","display":false},{"tex":"i+1\\le n","display":false}],"bytes":1521,"backlinks":[{"id":"dc27d1abcea524e3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-single-letter-fixed-algorithm]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"单字母构造：[[89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace]] → [[89-lem-single-letter-trace-stability]] → [[89-lem-single-letter-trace-semantics]] → [[89-df-single-letter-fixed-algorithm]] → [[89-thm-single-letter-fixed-point]]。"}],"outgoing":["4c9feb1083d7b4dd","04ea1c6ff126f884","932deccafc8aeaa8"]}